{"duracion": 53.0, "fps": 30, "lineas": [{"id": "01", "escena": "gancho", "texto": "Si dice «hola mamá, he cambiado de número», es estafa.", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 4.452, "palabras": [{"p": "Si", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 0.67}, {"p": "dice", "t0": 0.761, "t1": 1.185}, {"p": "«hola", "t0": 1.378, "t1": 1.668}, {"p": "mamá,", "t0": 1.713, "t1": 2.026}, {"p": "he", "t0": 2.253, "t1": 2.416}, {"p": "cambiado", "t0": 2.462, "t1": 2.779}, {"p": "de", "t0": 2.839, "t1": 2.961}, {"p": "número»,", "t0": 3.013, "t1": 3.418}, {"p": "es", "t0": 3.748, "t1": 3.981}, {"p": "estafa.", "t0": 4.027, "t1": 4.452}]}, {"id": "02", "escena": "llega", "texto": "Llega por WhatsApp, desde un número que usted no conoce.", "t0": 5.052, "t1": 8.245, "palabras": [{"p": "Llega", "t0": 5.052, "t1": 5.425}, {"p": "por", "t0": 5.447, "t1": 5.527}, {"p": "WhatsApp,", "t0": 5.576, "t1": 6.052}, {"p": "desde", "t0": 6.376, "t1": 6.627}, {"p": "un", "t0": 6.687, "t1": 6.808}, {"p": "número", "t0": 6.847, "t1": 7.081}, {"p": "que", "t0": 7.126, "t1": 7.262}, {"p": "usted", "t0": 7.322, "t1": 7.625}, {"p": "no", "t0": 7.655, "t1": 7.735}, {"p": "conoce.", "t0": 7.761, "t1": 8.245}]}, {"id": "03", "escena": "suplanta", "texto": "Dice ser su hijo o su hija. Que se le ha roto el móvil. Que guarde este número nuevo.", "t0": 8.745, "t1": 14.719, "palabras": [{"p": "Dice", "t0": 8.745, "t1": 9.048}, {"p": "ser", "t0": 9.116, "t1": 9.32}, {"p": "su", "t0": 9.411, "t1": 9.592}, {"p": "hijo", "t0": 9.665, "t1": 9.955}, {"p": "o", "t0": 10.046, "t1": 10.137}, {"p": "su", "t0": 10.197, "t1": 10.318}, {"p": "hija.", "t0": 10.386, "t1": 10.728}, {"p": "Que", "t0": 11.461, "t1": 11.566}, {"p": "se", "t0": 11.597, "t1": 11.677}, {"p": "le", "t0": 11.687, "t1": 11.767}, {"p": "ha", "t0": 11.778, "t1": 11.858}, {"p": "roto", "t0": 11.898, "t1": 12.11}, {"p": "el", "t0": 12.141, "t1": 12.221}, {"p": "móvil.", "t0": 12.261, "t1": 12.564}, {"p": "Que", "t0": 12.955, "t1": 13.035}, {"p": "guarde", "t0": 13.296, "t1": 13.721}, {"p": "este", "t0": 13.776, "t1": 13.993}, {"p": "número", "t0": 14.046, "t1": 14.356}, {"p": "nuevo.", "t0": 14.416, "t1": 14.719}]}, {"id": "04", "escena": "dinero", "texto": "Y al rato, le pide dinero con prisa: una transferencia o un Bizum, para un problema que no puede esperar.", "t0": 15.269, "t1": 22.502, "palabras": [{"p": "Y", "t0": 15.269, "t1": 15.349}, {"p": "al", "t0": 15.672, "t1": 15.844}, {"p": "rato,", "t0": 15.889, "t1": 16.207}, {"p": "le", "t0": 16.471, "t1": 16.593}, {"p": "pide", "t0": 16.638, "t1": 16.865}, {"p": "dinero", "t0": 16.917, "t1": 17.228}, {"p": "con", "t0": 17.273, "t1": 17.409}, {"p": "prisa:", "t0": 17.44, "t1": 17.894}, {"p": "una", "t0": 18.547, "t1": 18.657}, {"p": "transferencia", "t0": 18.707, "t1": 19.474}, {"p": "o", "t0": 19.564, "t1": 19.655}, {"p": "un", "t0": 19.715, "t1": 19.836}, {"p": "Bizum,", "t0": 19.904, "t1": 20.451}, {"p": "para", "t0": 20.724, "t1": 20.857}, {"p": "un", "t0": 20.888, "t1": 20.968}, {"p": "problema", "t0": 20.998, "t1": 21.401}, {"p": "que", "t0": 21.447, "t1": 21.583}, {"p": "no", "t0": 21.643, "t1": 21.764}, {"p": "puede", "t0": 21.81, "t1": 22.036}, {"p": "esperar.", "t0": 22.082, "t1": 22.502}]}, {"id": "05", "escena": "que-hacer", "texto": "Qué hacer: no conteste y no pague.", "t0": 23.352, "t1": 26.079, "palabras": [{"p": "Qué", "t0": 23.352, "t1": 23.432}, {"p": "hacer:", "t0": 23.467, "t1": 23.863}, {"p": "no", "t0": 24.494, "t1": 24.574}, {"p": "conteste", "t0": 24.632, "t1": 25.199}, {"p": "y", "t0": 25.29, "t1": 25.38}, {"p": "no", "t0": 25.441, "t1": 25.562}, {"p": "pague.", "t0": 25.653, "t1": 26.079}]}, {"id": "06", "escena": "llame", "texto": "Llame a su hijo al número DE SIEMPRE, el que ya tenía guardado. Y no borre nunca ese número.", "t0": 26.679, "t1": 32.821, "palabras": [{"p": "Llame", "t0": 26.679, "t1": 26.886}, {"p": "a", "t0": 26.932, "t1": 27.012}, {"p": "su", "t0": 27.037, "t1": 27.158}, {"p": "hijo", "t0": 27.213, "t1": 27.431}, {"p": "al", "t0": 27.461, "t1": 27.541}, {"p"